OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway closed in both directions
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M2 in Kent has been
OL,7,Fclosed in both directions after a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FKent Police said the motorway was
OL,11,Fclosed between junction four for
OL,12,FGillingham and junction five for
OL,13,FSittingbourne after a serious collision
OL,14,Fon the coastbound carriageway near
OL,15,FMedway Services.
OL,17,FOfficers said the crash happened just
OL,18,Fafter 21:00 BST on Tuesday and warned
OL,19,Fthe road would remain closed for "a
OL,20,Fsignificant period of time".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
