OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway closed in both directions
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, police posted on social
OL,7,Fmedia that the coastbound carriageway
OL,8,Fremains closed between junction three
OL,9,Ffor Maidstone and junction five.
OL,10,FOfficers said the London-bound route is
OL,11,Falso closed between junctions five and
OL,12,Ffour.
